        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>TH1118-T Global offset door pivot hinges, Kawneer style Top Pivot</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe TH1118-T offset pivots are used for both flush face frame installation and 1/8\" recessed door applications. Kawneer Top Pivot Hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/kawneer-style-offset-door-pivot-set-global-th1118\"><b>Kawnher Door Pivot Hinge Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/kawneer-door-bottom-center-hung-pivot-hinge\"><b>Kawneer Bottom Center Hung Pivot Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSuitable for doors weighing up to 125 pounds. These Kawneer pivots are engineered for durability, style, and are easy to install.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TH1118-T.pdf?v=1704262219\" target=\"new\"><b>Global TH1118-T Dimensions (PDF)</b></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>3/4\" offset pivots for aluminum doors and frames</li>\r\n<li>For flush door / frame and 1/8\" recessed doors</li>\r\n<li>Weather resistant</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum case construction</li>\r\n<li>Vertical adjustment 1/8\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Completely temper proof, yet easily removable, replacable in unlocked position</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Available in two finishes: AL- Aluminum or DU- Dark Bronze (Duronotic).</li>\r\n<li>Kawneer TOP pivot only (see image)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> Kawneer Top pivot only. <a href=\"/products/kawneer-style-offset-door-pivot-set-global-th1118\"><b>Click Here for Kawneer Pivot Hinge Set</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
